---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

import Link from "../../components/Link.astro";

import ProjectHeader from "../../components/ProjectHeader.astro";
import SmallHeading from "../../components/SmallHeading.astro";
import ProjectGrid from "../../components/ProjectGrid.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import cover from "../../images/deliberate/cover.png";

import userFlow from "../../images/deliberate/user-flow.png";
import one from "../../images/deliberate/1.png";
import two from "../../images/deliberate/2.png";
import three from "../../images/deliberate/3.png";
import four from "../../images/deliberate/4.png";
import five from "../../images/deliberate/5.png";
import six from "../../images/deliberate/6.png";
import seven from "../../images/deliberate/7.png";
import eight from "../../images/deliberate/8.png";

import videopage from "../../images/deliberate/video-page.png";

import datavis1 from "../../images/deliberate/data-vis-1.png";
import datavis2 from "../../images/deliberate/data-vis-1.png";
import datavis3 from "../../images/deliberate/data-vis-1.png";
import datavis4 from "../../images/deliberate/data-vis-1.png";

import web1 from "../../images/deliberate/web-1.png";
import web2 from "../../images/deliberate/web-2.png";
import web3 from "../../images/deliberate/web-3.png";
import web4 from "../../images/deliberate/web-4.png";
---

<Layout title="Brian Sekelsky">
  <main>
    <ProjectHeader
      title="Deliberate AI"
      objective="Designing mental health clinician-ready applications and data visualizations integrated with artificial intelligence."
      types={["User Experience", "User Interface", "AI"]}
      collaborators={[
        "Michael Balangue",
        "Nuno Parente",
        "Ben Barone",
        "Yuri Guimarães",
      ]}
      year="2022"
      heroImage={cover}
      heroAlt="Preview of Deliberate AI applications"
    />
    <ProjectGrid>
        <div class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-2">
          <SmallHeading text="Background" />
          <p>
            I spent the summer of 2022 as a Product Designer at Deliberate AI, a
            mental health tech start-up. I built the design system for their
            flagship application, which organizes and analyzes data for mental
            health clinicians. It's a start-up, so I wore a lot of hats. Along
            with UI and UX work, I produced marketing materials and a product
            website.
          </p>
        </div>
        <!--////////////////////////////-->
        <div class="col-span-1">
          <SmallHeading text="Process" />
          <p>
            I had a lot to learn about how mental health clinicians work. I read
            what I could and talked with the in-house clinicians.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1">
          <Image class="shadow-sm" src={userFlow} alt="User flow diagram for clinician workflow" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <SmallHeading text="Basic Design System" />
          <p>
            I inherited cluttered Figma files with inconsistent components,
            colors, and typography. I built a simple design system to tie the
            brand identity and interface together.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-4">
            <Image class="" src={one} alt="Design system color palette" />
            <Image class="" src={two} alt="Typography specifications" />
            <Image class="" src={three} alt="Button component variants" />
            <Image class="" src={four} alt="Form input components" />
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            <Image class="" src={five} alt="Card component designs" />
            <Image class="" src={six} alt="Navigation component patterns" />
            <Image class="" src={seven} alt="Modal dialog components" />
            <Image class="" src={eight} alt="Data table components" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1">
          <p>
            Once I understood the clinician workflow and what the AI could do,
            we defined the features. One is a scannable analysis and transcript
            of each patient-clinician session.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1">
          <Image class="shadow-sm" src={videopage} alt="Session transcript and analysis interface" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1">
          <p>
            We built several data visualization options for tracking patient
            progress across different mental health questionnaire frameworks.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div>
            <Image class="shadow-sm" src={datavis1} alt="Patient progress chart visualization" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <Image class="shadow-sm" src={datavis2} alt="Mental health questionnaire scores over time" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <Image class="shadow-sm" src={datavis3} alt="Treatment outcome metrics dashboard" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <Image class="shadow-sm" src={datavis4} alt="Clinical assessment trend analysis" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-2">
          <SmallHeading text="Marketing Website" />
          <p>
            I designed a product page covering the features available to three
            kinds of user, clinicians, supervisors, and clinic directors.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1">
          <Image class="shadow-sm" src={web1} alt="Deliberate AI marketing website hero section" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1">
          <Image class="shadow-sm" src={web2} alt="Features overview for clinicians" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1">
          <Image class="shadow-sm" src={web3} alt="Supervisor dashboard preview" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1">
          <Image class="shadow-sm" src={web4} alt="Clinic director analytics view" />
        </div>
      </ProjectGrid>
  </main>
</Layout>
